{"reviews":[{"id":"B007HERMKI-0","r":5.0,"t":"Very intricate","x":"Heavy duty necklace at an awesome price. This is one of the things that I purchased for my metalhead wife and she absolutely loves it! Score!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great unique necklace.","x":"I love the necklace, and there was fast delivery and definatly one of a kind. I ordered this for my Aunt and I know she will love it as much as I did, the only thing is I wish the necklace was a little bit longer.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-2","r":5.0,"t":"Exactly As Pictured","x":"I purchased this for my girlfriend to wear and she really likes it more than I thought she would. It is great.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-3","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE!","x":"THIS NECKLACE IS AMAZING. (: THE COLORS WITHIN THE BULB STICK OUT AND ARE VERY PLEASANT TO THE EYE. LOVE IT.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-4","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"Thank you, I love it,, I've gotten tons of compliments on it. I would like to see what else you have.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-5","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the money","x":"Three days into wearing this necklace the skull pendant fell out. I guess I could use some crazy glue to stick it back on but, what a waste. I love the necklace but, I wouldn't recommend this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-6","r":1.0,"t":"not worth the cash gave one star cuz it looks like photo shown !","x":"Looks like product show but is so cheaply put together it had super glue all over the outside of the pendent !Disappointed","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-7","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste time or money","x":"Don't waste time or money.  It does not look like picture at all.  You cannot tell what it is from more than 4' away","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-8","r":5.0,"t":"Love my necklace","x":"Love my necklace! It looks as cool in person as it does in the picture. Very happy with this purchase!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2015"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-9","r":1.0,"t":"Don't bother","x":"The item looks much nicer in the pictures. It is not what I expected. Very cheap looking.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-10","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"made of brass not worth your good money!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-11","r":5.0,"t":"PEFECT for every day! Classic of a Steampunk!!!","x":"It is truly a GREAT necklace that would go with almost ANYTHING!  I have been looking for a necklace with a skull for A WHILE! I wanted something that I could wear every day and it would go with almost anything!!!  And this is the P-E-R-F-E-C-T! Absolutely perfect!!  It is made EXTREMELY well!!! I LOVE the chain! I love the Skull and I LOVE everything about this cute little thing!!! It DOESN`T look cheap! And I am VERY pleased with the quality of the piece!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-12","r":4.0,"t":"Necklace","x":"I received the necklace 9-10 days after ordering it. The photos are true to the actual necklace. However, the actual skull necklace seems like it has more blue in it than the actual photo. It's a super cool design. The necklace is shorter than I prefer, but it could always be switched out. The entire necklace is good material and heavy duty! Worth my money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-13","r":3.0,"t":"Pretty much what everyone has been saying ...","x":"The chain is awful and has to be replaced. It's too short and is quite rough. The pendant itself is certainly worth the price but isn't as vibrant as shown on the website. The photo makes it look like it's got some depth when in fact it's just a flat picture under plastic. Still an interesting piece and I'm keeping it. Great for wearing on Day of the Dead.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-14","r":4.0,"t":"Not bad for the price","x":"The pendant itself was very cool and definitely something different. I bought it as a gift for a friend who shares a love of skulls. I was disappointed in the chain, it looked very cheapy in comparison to the pendant, however the good thing is you can always slide it off and get another necklace that suites your needs.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-15","r":4.0,"t":"Cool Skull Pendant","x":"This is a very cool pendant!  It looks almost exactly like the picture online.  If you want or need something different having to do with skulls this would be great. I bought it as a gift for my sister.  It is fun and looks much more expensive than it is. I would recommend this to anyone.  It's fun!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2015"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-16","r":5.0,"t":"You won't be disappointed","x":"This Piece is beautiful.  Well crafted.  I purchased this as a gift for my girlfriend and she absolutely adores it.  The only negative I can post is that it comes with a generic &#34;dog tag-style&#34; necklace, but I'm still giving a 5-star review because I didn't order it for the necklace.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-17","r":5.0,"t":"Very good looking necklace","x":"I bought this necklace because the reviews were good, and it surpassed my expectations. Just the right length, beautiful artwork. I love skulls, and this makes a festive addition to my collection. Highly recommended.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-18","r":5.0,"t":"pretty for a skull","x":"Not sure about the recipient because I bought for someone else to give as a gift, but it is very cute and pretty for a skull.  This old lady isn't too into skulls, but if you like skulls I think you would like this.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-19","r":2.0,"t":"ODDITY Steampunk Victorian Necklace","x":"This necklace looks like it just came out of a gum ball machine...  very cheap looking.  I like the fact the seller got it here quickly before Christmas but definitely not worth the price","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-20","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful detailing","x":"I received this necklace today and I love it.  The quality is very nice and the colors on the skull are beautiful.  I know this necklace will get a ton of wear from me.  Love it!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-21","r":5.0,"t":"So nice I bought it twice!","x":"Really love the detail on the charm and the chain is actually pretty nice for the price.  My friend liked mine so much I bought her one for Valentine's Day. Super cute!!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-22","r":4.0,"t":"Skulltastic","x":"Lots of compliments thus far. Very pretty piece, I'm enjoying it! One can never have enough skulls in their life. Well, that's my opinion anyhow lol","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2013"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-23","r":4.0,"t":"wasn't what I expected but I do enjoy it","x":"The pendent is great it looks a little cheap and it was a little shorter then I thought but it is of good quality so far and still does look cute.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B007HERMKI-24","r":5.0,"t":"Just what I was looking for.","x":"Very nice and attractive steam punk pendant. I purchased this and a Christmas  gift for my granddaughter. I have no doubt she will love it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many customers love the necklace's unique, intricate design and say it looks as good as or exactly like the photos.","cites":[1,2,3,4,9,12,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers find the chain too short and/or cheap-looking, often replacing it.","cites":[2,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some customers report poor build quality, with the pendant falling apart or having visible glue.","cites":[6,7]},{"text":"A number of reviewers feel the item looks cheap or unlike the pictures and is not worth the money.","cites":[8,10,11]},{"text":"Buyers frequently mention giving it as a gift and the recipient loving it.","cites":[1,2,3,15]}]},"qa":[]}